   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "⚗ ALCHEMICA PRO — phases + previews\n\nTWO-PHASE PROMPT\nscene = subject, pose, framing, overall light, colours, style.\ndetail = rendering: skin, materials, grain, optics.\nThe scene leads until the composition is decided (sigma ~0.87,\nmeasured by the calibration), then the detail leads.\nEmpty detail = behaves like AlchemicaKrea.\nIt changes skin, fabric, patterns, small objects.\nIt does NOT change colours or style (b/w, painting): those are\ndecided in the first step, together with the composition.\nAvoid \"imperfections\" on fine-tunes: it makes bumps.\ncambio_fase -1 = from the profile · lower = detail weighs less\nsfumatura 0 = hard switch (no extra cost)\n\nPREVIEWS (seed on 'fixed'!)\n1. anteprime = 8 -> Queue: 8 small images (max ~30 s each),\n   numbered #0..#7\n2. pick a number, set anteprime = 0 and scelta = that number\n3. Queue: same pose and framing at full resolution\n   (a piece of clothing may change)\n\nREFINEMENT VARIANT (variante_rifinitura)\nsame pose and framing; face, lettering, jewellery and small\nobjects change: 1, 2, 3...\n\nPROFILE (auto): the one calibrated on this model at the closest\nresolution (3 MP or 4 MP)."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "⚗ AlchemicaMente · notes"
  }
